  triage:description "Sprint doc docs/plans/phase-ao2/sprint-AO2-13-benchmark-run-skill.md:73-74 acceptance criterion 4 requires a dry-run transcript of the full skill executed on macOS (steps 1-4 against a real run) committed as sprint evidence. No such artifact exists in the repo (confirmed via repo-wide grep for 'transcript' by quality-mgr and independently by req-qa and arch-qa). The two committed campaign.json files under site/reports/send-message-benchmark/ are raw benchmark measurement data, not a transcript of an operator following the skill's steps 1-4 verbatim (including the just benchmark-show / wyvern review step). Required correction: commit a dry-run transcript (terminal session log or narrated walkthrough) showing steps 1-4 executed on macOS, linked from the sprint doc." ;
